{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1475861-reverse-engineering-endowment-effects","id":1475861,"title":"Reverse Engineering Endowment Effects","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-05T15:52:57-08:00","id":1475861,"title":"Reverse Engineering Endowment Effects","content":"Chapter Eight of the 2E Hunter core book gives us a brief look at the design philosophy and mechanical balance behind Endowments, including a table breaking down the &quot;value&quot; of various beneficial effects and the costs/backlashes that, combined, create a theoretically balanced Endowment. However, while the official Endowments in Chapter Three nearly all use costs or backlashes listed in the table, most of their effects are not represented. And reverse engineering the value of every single one of those effects based on the their costs/backlashes would take hours and someone truly obsessive. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So anyway here is all of the effects I was able to tease out that aren't covered by the original table: <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; width: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Value</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Effect</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Example</b></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Use the higher of Wits or Dexterity to calculate Defense</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Speed of Thought</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Half the time interval of an extended action</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Codex</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Move to the top of the Initiative</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Speed of Thought</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Against a particular class of entity, replicate the effects of one of: exorcism, abjuration, warding, or binding (without the need for specific banes).</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Expulsion</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Speak any mundane language</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Tongue of Babel</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Improve Impression by one step for Social Maneuvering</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Tongue of Babel</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">0</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Borrow another's senses</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Tag</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">See into all phases of Twilight and gain a Clash of Wills against invisible creatures</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Devil's Eyes</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Gain an additional Clue on a successful roll related to an Investigation</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Third Eye</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Cause an object to emit bright light</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Wrathful Sword of St. Michael the Archangel</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Share one's perceptions with others</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Dark Reflection</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Enable resisting a class of Conditions and Tilts with a successful roll</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Fortitude of St. George</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Add endowment rating to extended action activation rolls*</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Benediction</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Acquire Clues equal to success on the activation roll</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Postcognition</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Issue a single-sentence command that the target must obey. Each additional command adds +1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Command Ghost</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Dispel a class of effects with a successful Clash of Wills</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Know Death</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Provide immunity to an environmental hazard (e.g. Fire)</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Forged In Fire</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Extend senses to a point 10 yards away per success</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Sonic Resonance Attenuator</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">4</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Receive the answer to a single question concerning events up to a week in the future</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Hall of Mirrors</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">4</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Turn invisible/imperceptible</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Amun's Water</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">4</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Ignore breaking points until the end of the duration, when only a single one is rolled</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Breath of Ma'at</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">4</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Heal one lethal or two bashing damage per success on the activation roll</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Bennu Feather</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">4</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Learn one of a target's weaknesses</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Sense Weakness</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Single use of a Numen</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Borrow Power</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Project one's consciousness into Twilight</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Incense of the Next World</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Any scalable effect, with value equal to Endowment rating**</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Benediction</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Make a target cooperative and suggestible</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Mesmeric Vapors</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">8</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Heal 5 bashing or lethal damage, or downgrade 5 aggravated damage**</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Hand's of St. Luke</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">12</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Raise the dead***</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Boon of Lazarus</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">12</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Summon or banish demons****</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Calling Forth the Pit</td> </tr> </table></div> *Near as I can figure, every Benediction has a hidden +2 effect, which I am assuming is the bonus they get to the extended action activation roll.<br /> **Factoring in the above, it worked out that value of every scalable Benediction effect based on the user's Benediction rating was 5. Which makes a certain amount of sense, since that would be the value if it just started at full effect, even if I don't really like that you pay for an effect you don't have full access to until you max out your Endowment rating.<br /> ***I couldn't come up with a clean way to split these effects that would bring the value to 5 or lower.<br /> ****This also includes restoring the target to full health. Maybe there's some logic I'm missing that would result in individual effects with a maximum value of 5.<br /> *****If I make myself dizzy and squint really hard I can maybe see the summoning and banishing effects separately each having value of 5.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; width: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Relative value</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Variable Effect</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Example</b></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Armor rating -2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Armor against a limited source of damage</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Auric Shield</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Bonus +1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Increase an Attribute</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Fortitude of St. George</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Damage rating</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Deal bashing damage</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Talon</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Damage rating -1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Add a new attack form requiring a separate action, or increase damage rating of an existing attack form*</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Tools of the Trade</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Retainer rating**</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Summonable minion</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Personal Defense Swarm</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Normal cost +1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Personal Tilt affecting multiple targets</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">Hand of Glory</td> </tr> </table></div> *I believe the logic here is that it's equivalent to an attack effect with a rating equal to value -1, as described in the original table, but with a -2 for requiring a resisted action i.e. a normal attack roll.<br /> **I'm extrapolating from the fact that the 4-dice Personal Defense Swarm is a 2 point effect, and therefore sounds like a 2 dot Retainer to me.<br /> <br /> Other miscellaneous observations: spending a Willpower dot is a -4 cost. A Backlash Condition that can be resisted is -1 instead of -2. And Polygraph is missing three points of costs or backlashes: the lethal damage backlash only covers the value of the duration, leaving 3 uncovered from the exceptional success benefit. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That just leaves the stragglers: Regenerative Nodule and Time Attenuator. The problem is that they both have unique effects <i>and </i>costs, with no equivalent in other Endowments to compare too. If I had to spitball, I'd put Time Attenuator's effect at 3 and Regenerative Nodule's at 4.<br /> <br /> These results feel about right given my intuition about game balance. Some surprised me, but none seem ludicrously off. Overall, it was nice to see how consistently most of the math worked out, especially when I had to start extrapolating. Hopefully these results will prove interesting or useful to somebody. Let me know if you want more details on how I came to any conclusions (or if I obviously messed up anywhere).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">The longer I study science the more I am convinced that it is <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">functionally indistinguishable from what our ancestors would refer to as sorcery</span>. And I would know, being both scientist and sorcerer.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23730-scriptorian","name":"Scriptorian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23730_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-16T09:39:11-07:00","id":1476524,"title":"","content":"We appreciate your obsessive nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2096-willywonka","name":"willywonka","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-13T10:23:52-07:00","id":1478772,"title":"","content":"It is really impressive work and will be incredibly useful to me. Many thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25189-dagurasu","name":"Dagurasu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}